WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.902
Welcome to our training on how multi-channel fulfillment or MCF works.

00:00:04.902 --> 00:00:08.578
Modern business owners typically use multiple online sales channels.

00:00:08.578 --> 00:00:15.114
These might include the Amazon Store, an e-commerce website dedicated to their product or business,

00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:17.565
or social media accounts, for example.

00:00:17.565 --> 00:00:24.101
With MCF, businesses of any size, using any online sales channels, can take advantage of Amazon's

00:00:24.101 --> 00:00:26.144
product storage and order fulfillment.

00:00:26.144 --> 00:00:29.820
It allows you to maintain control over your sales.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.880
While letting Amazon fulfill your online orders from a single inventory source, we recommend using

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:42.461
MCF to help scale your business without increasing your fixed costs.

00:00:42.461 --> 00:00:44.960
For example, you can use Amazon's

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:50.640
fulfillment operations and scalable storage capacity to manage seasonal spikes in demand

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:51.945
for your products.

00:00:51.945 --> 00:00:53.685
Here's how MCF works.

00:00:53.685 --> 00:00:57.600
There's no separate enrollment process for MCF if you

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.338
have an Amazon selling account.

00:00:59.338 --> 00:01:03.160
All you'll need to do is send your inventory to Amazon's

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:03.880
fulfillment centers.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:08.920
That way, the next time a customer places an order on any of your

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:15.000
online sales channels, you can choose one of three options to create a fulfillment order.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.155
First, you can create orders one at a time.

00:01:18.155 --> 00:01:20.960
Second, you can upload a spreadsheet to create

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:22.357
orders in bulk.

00:01:22.357 --> 00:01:27.480
Third, you can create an automatic order through pre-built integrations

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:28.365
or APIs.

00:01:28.365 --> 00:01:33.675
Amazon will pick, pack and ship products for the orders you submit.

00:01:33.675 --> 00:01:34.560
Your customers

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:40.540
can track their MCF orders in real time and should receive them one to two days after shipment

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:42.295
from a fulfillment center.

00:01:42.295 --> 00:01:48.000
We use Amazon packaging for orders placed in our store and brand neutral

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:51.134
packaging for those placed through other e-commerce channels.

00:01:51.134 --> 00:01:53.920
You can choose from a number of options

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:57.472
and shipping speeds based on what suits your needs.

00:01:57.472 --> 00:01:59.840
Your customers can receive their MCF

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:04.800
orders as quickly as one to two days after shipment from a fulfillment center and track

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:07.000
those orders in real time.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:11.400
Review the Seller Central Help page titled Multi-Channel Fulfillment,

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:16.720
fulfill orders for your sales channels for more information on MCF shipping and delivery

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:17.211
timelines.

00:02:17.211 --> 00:02:23.600
As with other Amazon orders, items can be returned to an Amazon fulfillment

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:25.040
center for processing.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:29.360
Sellers are responsible, however, for providing customer service for

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:35.480
these orders, including addressing delivery inquiries and managing requests for replacements,

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:36.903
refunds and returns.

00:02:36.903 --> 00:02:42.120
Amazon charges a single fee for picking, packing and fulfilling MCF

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:45.640
orders and another for storing your inventory.

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:49.160
Storage costs vary depending on product size

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:55.760
tier, current month, product volume, average daily units and dangerous goods classification

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:56.392
status.

00:02:56.392 --> 00:03:05.865
To review MCF pricing and get a description of these storage fee categories, visit sellercentral.

00:03:05.865 --> 00:03:06.497
amazon.

00:03:06.497 --> 00:03:07.760
com/mcf

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:12.532
and select download the rate card PDF at the bottom of the page.

00:03:12.532 --> 00:03:14.000
This concludes our video

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.941
on MCF and its benefits.

00:03:15.941 --> 00:03:20.600
Search Send to Amazon in Seller University to learn how to send

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:26.920
your inventory to an Amazon fulfillment center and search Multi-Channel Fulfillment Create

00:03:26.920 --> 00:03:31.070
Fulfillment Orders to learn how to create an MCF order.

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:33.560
Thank you and happy selling in

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:34.720
the Amazon store!
